{"title":"2023 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>What is the value of the following limit?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b539f620ed598172e696507c7dcc4f322436824.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\lim_{x \\to 7} \\frac{2x^2 - 13x - 7}{x - 7}\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65fbac6749d331ef85674d669c99c1829fcc0e47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{The limit does not exist.} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\ 15 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\ 8 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{15} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\ 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"543\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Solution: \n</p><p>To evaluate the limit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c5c90452a0c0c1f3b8f781dc3d85f125bb1a043.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lim_{x \\to 7} \\frac{2x^2 - 13x - 7}{x - 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"145\" height=\"42\" />, we first observe that directly substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d1e7375e601943b3bb958a24e41da8920d601a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> into the expression results in the indeterminate form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/d/91d7ada08ad200c068f7060c22ead4ad2e1a2e8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{0}{0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. To resolve this, we factor the quadratic polynomial in the numerator, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/c/45c488b72cd2d9eaf91a418e4cba74b2f40ba9f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^2 - 13x - 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />, into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/3/51391c3bd38db7c724b87fd91c9800bcbce72d82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x + 1)(x - 7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"20\" />. Rewriting the fraction gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/b/63b9e0954b00974d379c2d59fb8760199c6e4ab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lim_{x \\to 7} \\frac{(2x + 1)(x - 7)}{x - 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"157\" height=\"42\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> approaches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> but never equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we can cancel the common non-zero term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/a/d8aae6503bb2d4e1a0d39eb0a32851ac86aec3e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" /> from both the numerator and the denominator, simplifying the expression to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/0/300aaa409041c598dec998ab128b3024daf520a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lim_{x \\to 7} (2x + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"28\" />. Finally, applying direct substitution yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/c/2fc4aaf299870ad6cc3d99f9ddc341d440b5ae88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(7) + 1 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" />. Therefore, the correct choice is (B).\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018024129\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 43/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2719/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37833:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018024129 and revision id 292372. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}